1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,500
A park full of dancing grandmas at full volume — public nuisance, or the healthiest retirement on earth?
{\fs13}I'm your China Travel Expert

2
00:00:03,500 --> 00:00:07,000
Every evening across China, squares and parks fill with dancers. The name is guangchangwu — "square dancing."

3
00:00:07,000 --> 00:00:10,500
Most are retired women. Some estimates put the dancers in the tens of millions — even over 100 million.

4
00:00:10,500 --> 00:00:14,000
Neighbours file noise complaints; groups fight over space. Some cities now set the hours and the volume.

5
00:00:14,000 --> 00:00:17,500
Think a free outdoor dance class on every corner. So — turn the speakers down, or let them dance? You decide.
